# Vandeta MITM payload - the rickroll PAGE (no video, no internet path needed).
#
# Same page as html/rickroll.html, served by the board for every request, so it
# still works when the poison cuts the target's internet path - and on a ucmitm
# twin, which never has one.
#
#   WiFi > Wifi Atks > MITM Attack > Payload > html-rickroll.mitm > Start

page * html/rickroll.html

# Every name resolves to the board while this runs, so a host that resolved
# before the poison still lands on the page instead of timing out.
dns * this
